<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ 67-1 AT LUNCH VS SRI LANKA IN 2ND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ 67-1 AT LUNCH VS SRI LANKA IN 2ND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, New Zealand 1996-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 67 for the loss of one wicket at lunch on the first day of their second cricket test against Sri Lanka on Friday.</p>
<p>Score: New Zealand 67 for one (B. Pocock 37 not out).</p>
